┌─ Keys · ? to close ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│Everywhere                                           Org pane                                             Agent pane                                          │
│  tab       next pane/field                            ↑↓    move                                           enter      start typing                           │
│  shift+tab previous pane                              ←→    fold / unfold                                  ctrl+q     stop typing                            │
│  ?         this help                                  enter type to agent                                  z          zoom / restore                         │
│  ,         settings                                   space give work                                      space      give work                              │
│  w         worktrees                                  s     start / stop                                   PgUp/Dn    scroll back                            │
│  f         filter tree by state                       r     resume                                                                                           │
│  esc       back one level                             n     new here…                                    Chat (Duo)                                          │
│  q         quit (agents run on)                       e     edit (Duo: Edit org)                           enter      send                                   │
│  ctrl+c    quit if not typing                         m     move to…                                       alt+enter  new line                               │
│  ctrl+↑↓   resize chat                                d     delete (stopped)                               @ /        agents / commands                      │
│                                                       z     zoom agent                                     PgUp/Dn    scroll history                         │
│Mouse                                                  v     last reply on/off                                                                                │
│  click     select + type                              o     open org.toml                                Card dialog                                         │
│  right     node menu                                                                                       y e n      approve/edit/reject                    │
│  wheel     scroll                                   Needs you                                              ←→↑↓ enter choose a button, press it              │
│  drag      move node                                  ↑↓    move                                           esc        close; the card stays                  │
│                                                       enter go to agent or card                                                                              │
